      "name": "Cloaker",
      "player": "DM",
      "race": ["aberration"],
      "notes": "Disguised as cloak on wall among real cloaks. Guards Room of Slaves. Subsonic moaning always active. L1: unease -2 hit (80ft). L2: fear spell (30ft, save vs Spells). L3: nausea cone 30ft (save vs Poison or helpless 2-5 rds). L4: hold person single target (5 rds). Cannot bite and moan same round. Stone blocks moaning. Envelops victim — arms pinned, bites 1d4+base AC/rd. Tail AC 1, 16 hp to cut off. Attacks on enveloped victim do half to cloaker, half to victim. Fire does full to both. Creates shadow duplicates (mirror image). If badly hurt: creates doubles, flees into shadows.",
      "ability_scores": {"str": 18, "dex": 18, "con": 19, "int": 14, "wis": 16, "cha": 14},
      "classes": [{"level": 8, "class": "aberration", "skills": ["stealth", "deception", "perception"]}],
